{"author":["Elastic"],"description":"检测 bpftool 加载/卸载/替换 BPF。对应需求：内核探针篡改。","from":"now-9m","index":["auditbeat-*","endgame-*","logs-auditd_manager.auditd-*","logs-endpoint.events.process*","logs-sentinel_one_cloud_funnel.*","logs-crowdstrike.fdr*"],"language":"eql","license":"Elastic License v2","name":"【默认】Linux用bpftool篡改BPF程序","note":"## 调查指引\n\n### 规则说明\nbpftool prog load/detach 等。\n\n### 为何重要\n可关闭安全探针或植入内核后门。\n\n### 调查步骤\n1. 核对进程名、命令行、父进程与用户。\n2. 核对路径、外连地址与时间是否符合变更窗口。\n3. 关联同主机前后同类告警、落地文件与持久化。\n\n### 常见误报\n- 合法变更窗口内的运维、开发或自动化脚本\n\n### 响应建议\n1. 确认是否授权与变更窗口。\n2. 无授权则隔离主机、终止可疑进程并排查落地文件。\n3. 按主机与用户关联前后同类告警与外连。\n","references":["https://manpages.ubuntu.com/manpages/jammy/man8/bpftool-prog.8.html","https://manpages.ubuntu.com/manpages/noble/man8/bpftool-map.8.html","https://man.archlinux.org/man/bpftool-link.8.en"],"risk_score":47,"rule_id":"1b65429e-bd92-44c0-aff8-e8065869d860","severity":"medium","tags":["操作系统: Linux","主题: 防御规避","来源: 默认","对应需求: BPF篡改"],"timestamp_override":"event.ingested","type":"eql","query":"process where host.os.type == \"linux\" and event.type == \"start\" and\nevent.action in (\"exec\", \"exec_event\", \"start\", \"ProcessRollup2\", \"executed\", \"process_started\") and\nprocess.name == \"bpftool\" and (\n  (process.args == \"prog\" and process.args == \"detach\") or\n  (process.args == \"map\" and process.args in (\"delete\", \"update\")) or\n  (process.args == \"link\" and process.args == \"detach\")\n)\n","threat":[{"framework":"MITRE ATT&CK","technique":[{"id":"T1014","name":"Rootkit","reference":"https://attack.mitre.org/techniques/T1014/"},{"id":"T1562","name":"Impair Defenses","reference":"https://attack.mitre.org/techniques/T1562/","subtechnique":[{"id":"T1562.001","name":"Disable or Modify Tools","reference":"https://attack.mitre.org/techniques/T1562/001/"}]}],"tactic":{"id":"TA0005","name":"Defense Evasion","reference":"https://attack.mitre.org/tactics/TA0005/"}}],"false_positives":["合法变更窗口内的运维、开发或自动化脚本"],"interval":"5m","related_integrations":[{"package":"endpoint","version":"*"},{"package":"auditd_manager","version":"*"},{"package":"sentinel_one_cloud_funnel","version":"*"},{"package":"crowdstrike","version":"*"}],"setup":"## 设置说明\n\n1. 目标主机安装 Elastic Agent，启用 **Elastic Defend**（需要进程/网络/文件事件，按规则数据源）。\n2. 确认相关数据流有数据后再评估告警。\n","investigation_fields":{"field_names":["@timestamp","host.name","user.name","user.id","process.name","process.parent.name","process.executable","process.command_line","process.parent.executable","event.action","file.path","source.ip","destination.ip","message"]},"version":3,"immutable":true,"rule_source":{"type":"external","is_customized":true,"customized_fields":[{"field_name":"name"},{"field_name":"description"},{"field_name":"note"},{"field_name":"setup"},{"field_name":"false_positives"},{"field_name":"tags"},{"field_name":"investigation_fields"}],"has_base_version":true},"actions":[],"exceptions_list":[],"risk_score_mapping":[],"severity_mapping":[],"required_fields":[],"output_index":"","revision":1,"enabled":true,"max_signals":100,"to":"now"}
